# S03: e1m8, a crane over the ziggurat in its lava, Classic at 320x200, no status bar. The
# first key is id's intermission camera for the map; the move is eased over file seconds 1
# to 4.5 and the handles hold its end poses. Brightness 0.6: e1m8 is dark.

map e1m8

duration 5.5
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.6

camera path
key 1    144,592,-112  30,315  ease inout
key 4.5  200,560,-40   35,300

events on
